lood and Tears to the Moonlight&#34;</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/31/Constellation_I_Offer_Blood_and_Tears_to_the_Moonlight.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024434\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation &quot;I Offer Blood and Tears to the Moonlight&quot;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/31/Constellation_I_Offer_Blood_and_Tears_to_the_Moonlight.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024434\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/31/Constellation_I_Offer_Blood_and_Tears_to_the_Moonlight.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024434 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/31/Constellation_I_Offer_Blood_and_Tears_to_the_Moonlight.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024434 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation &quot;I Offer Blood and Tears to the Moonlight&quot;\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_%22I_Offer_Blood_and_Tears_to_the_Moonlight%22.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation &quot;I Offer Blood and Tears to the Moonlight&quot;.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/%22If_Truth_May_Be_Subject_to_Witness%22\" title=\"&quot;If Truth May Be Subject to Witness&quot;\">\"If Truth May Be Subject to Witness\"</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">-</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When the <span class=\"text-menu\"><b>Frostgrove Sanctuary</b></span> attacks opponents, it will deal 1 additional instance of <span class=\"text-dendro\"><b>AOE Dendro DMG</b></span> equal to 185% of Lauma's <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a>. This DMG is considered Lunar-Bloom DMG.<br />This instance of DMG will not consume any <span class=\"text-menu\"><b>Pale Hymn</b></span> stacks and will provide Lauma with 2 stacks of Pale Hymn, as well as refreshing the duration of Pale Hymn stacks gained in this manner.<br />This effect can occur up to 8 times during each Frostgrove Sanctuary. When using the <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Skill\" title=\"Elemental Skill\">Elemental Skill</a> <span class=\"text-menu\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Runo:_Dawnless_Rest_of_Karsikko\" title=\"Runo: Dawnless Rest of Karsikko\">Runo: Dawnless Rest of Karsikko</a></b></span>, all Pale Hymn stacks gained in this manner will be removed.<br /><br />Additionally, when Lauma uses a <a href=\"/wiki/Normal_Attack\" title=\"Normal Attack\">Normal Attack</a> while she has Pale Hymn stacks, she will consume 1 stack to convert this to deal <span class=\"text-dendro\"><b>Dendro DMG</b></span> equal to 150% of her Elemental Mastery. This DMG is considered Lunar-Bloom DMG.<br /><br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b>: All nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a> members' Lunar-Bloom DMG is <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\"><b>elevated</b></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Elevation</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Special DMG Boost effect. It is calculated independently of other DMG Boost effects.</span></span></span> by 25%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Direct_Lunar-Bloom\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Direct Lunar-Bloom\">Direct Lunar-Bloom</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Effect_Triggered_by_Normal_Attack_Use\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Effect Triggered by Normal Attack Use\">Effect Triggered by Normal Attack Use</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DMG Elevation\">DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Bloom DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonsign:_Ascendant_Gleam\" title=\"Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam\">Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>\"I Offer Blood and Tears to the Moonlight\"</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_6_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 6 Constellation\">Level 6 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2F%2522I_Offer_Blood_and_Tears_to_the_Moonlight%2522%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>\"I Offer Blood and Tears to the Moonlight\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">「我愿将这血与泪奉予月明」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Wǒ Yuàn Jiāng Zhè Xuè yǔ Lèi Fèngyǔ Yuèmíng\"</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">\"I'm Willing to Offer These Blood and Tears to the Moonlight\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「我願將這血與淚奉予月明」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Wǒ Yuàn Jiāng Zhè Xuè yǔ Lèi Fèngyǔ Yuèmíng\"</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">「我が血と涙を</span> <span lang=\"ja\">月に捧げ奉らん」</span><br /><small><i>\"Waga Chi to Namida wo Tsuki ni Sasage Tatematsuran\"&#8205;&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"&lt;sup&gt;&#91;!&#93;&lt;/sup&gt;\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\"><sup>[!]</sup></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Assumed reading</span></span>&#8205;</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">「내</span> <span lang=\"ko\">피와</span> <span lang=\"ko\">눈물을</span> <span lang=\"ko\">달빛에</span> <span lang=\"ko\">바치리라」</span><br /><small><i>\"Nae Piwa Nunmureul Dalbiche Bachirira\"</i></small></td><td>\"I Shall Offer My Blood and Tears to the Moonlight\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td><span lang=\"es\">“</span>Ofrezco mi sangre y mis l<span lang=\"es\">á</span>grimas a la luna<span lang=\"es\">”</span></td><td>\"I Offer My Blood and My Tears to the Moon\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td><span lang=\"fr\">«</span>&#160;<span lang=\"fr\">À</span> la lune, j'offre mon sang et mes <span lang=\"fr\">é</span>mois&#160;<span lang=\"fr\">»</span></td><td>\"To the Moon, I Offer My Blood and Turmoils\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">«Я</span> <span lang=\"ru\">подношу</span> <span lang=\"ru\">кровь</span> <span lang=\"ru\">и</span> <span lang=\"ru\">слёзы</span> <span lang=\"ru\">лунному</span> <span lang=\"ru\">свету»</span><br /><small><i>\"Ya podnoshu krov' i slyozy lunnomu svetu\"</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>\"I Offer Blood and Tears to the Moonlight\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">\"Nguyện Dâng Máu Lệ Tặng Ánh Trăng\"</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td><span lang=\"de\">„</span>Blut und Tr<span lang=\"de\">ä</span>nen opfere ich dem Mond<span lang=\"de\">“</span></td><td>\"I Sacrifice Blood and Tears to the Moon\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>\"I Offer Blood and Tears to the Moonlight\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>\"Desejo Dar o Sangue e as L<span lang=\"pt\">á</span>grimas <span lang=\"pt\">à</span> Lua\"</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>\"Kan<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>m<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span> ve Terimi Ay I<span lang=\"tr\">şığı</span>na Adar<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>m\"</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>\"Sangue e lacrime offro al chiaro di luna\"</td><td>\"Blood and Tears I Offer to the Moonlight\"</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2F%2522I_Offer_Blood_and_Tears_to_the_Moonlight%2522%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-